  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "An exciting game in which you have to take care of a cute bunny. Your
    task is to feed the hare cabbage, water, carrots and beets. To do this, you will
    need to cut off the corresponding colors indicated by the hare using a knife.
    If everything is correct and the required piece is cut off, then the amount of
    food required is reduced.\n\nBut be careful, with each level the speed and amount
    of food required for the hare increases. If you don't manage to feed the hare
    in time, he will run away and you will lose points.\n\nAfter you feed the rabbit,
    you have the choice to save your score and increase it in bonus mode, but you
    won\u2019t get to the next level, or press further and go to the next level,
    but there is a chance of losing your points.\n\nShow off your speed and agility
    skills and help the cute bunny satisfy his hunger!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c730b9be1760bb41925efbdc24e2830, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8105343638537245522, guid: 3c730b9be1760bb41925efbdc24e2830, type: 2}
